{"4984660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flower Delivery", "steam_appid": 4984660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a gardener who inherited a cozy little farm from your grandma. You've always wanted to fulfill her dream of creating a thriving flower business. Build your flower empire from the ground up on Petalway Island. Complete heartwarming missions and meet silly residents on your journey to the top.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your flowers from seeds, water them, care for them, and watch them grow to insanely huge sizes before delivering and selling them for a big profit. Discover new exotic flowers in every new location.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver your flowers into the little paws of Petalway Island's residents. Choose the right vehicle for each journey, as the roads can be difficult to traverse.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast open world of Petalway Island with its exotic biomes, each filled with new flowers, seeds, and equipment to discover.  <br> <br>Experience stunning, cozy landscapes and meet charming residents, each with their own personality.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and expand your farm, hire bees, and upgrade your vehicles and equipment as you progress through the story.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a gardener who inherited a cozy little farm from your grandma. You've always wanted to fulfill her dream of creating a thriving flower business. Build your flower empire from the ground up on Petalway Island. Complete heartwarming missions and meet silly residents on your journey to the top.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your flowers from seeds, water them, care for them, and watch them grow to insanely huge sizes before delivering and selling them for a big profit. Discover new exotic flowers in every new location.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver your flowers into the little paws of Petalway Island's residents. Choose the right vehicle for each journey, as the roads can be difficult to traverse.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast open world of Petalway Island with its exotic biomes, each filled with new flowers, seeds, and equipment to discover.  <br> <br>Experience stunning, cozy landscapes and meet charming residents, each with their own personality.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and expand your farm, hire bees, and upgrade your vehicles and equipment as you progress through the story.</p>", "short_description": "Grow flowers and deliver them to cute cartoon animals in a huge cozy open world. Explore a relaxing landscape with zero stress and no way to lose. Chill, vibe, grow beautiful flowers, enjoy the scenery, and complete heartwarming missions at your own pace.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984660/47c3e1b786d886eefe57319ce78dcb90c2fc4347/header.jpg?t=1784834456", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984660/e3c3419a0197b4211337a2cb31f69719fcd5aee1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784834456", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984660/e3c3419a0197b4211337a2cb31f69719fcd5aee1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784834456", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz 4-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"